WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:13.574
In this lesson, you will learn to design a fair level with a path, treasure and a goal, then solve it with as few blocks as you can.

2
00:00:14.174 --> 00:00:19.757
Game designers plan levels: where the walls, treasure and goal go.

3
00:00:20.357 --> 00:00:25.504
A good level is not too easy and not impossible.

4
00:00:26.104 --> 00:00:28.643
Level 1 is easy.

5
00:00:28.643 --> 00:00:31.183
Level 2 adds walls.

6
00:00:31.183 --> 00:00:34.157
Level 3 adds more treasure.

7
00:00:34.757 --> 00:00:39.904
Use numbers and repeats to solve levels with fewer blocks.

8
00:00:40.504 --> 00:00:44.783
Easy level: reach the star with 2 blocks.

9
00:00:44.783 --> 00:00:47.183
Level 1 complete!

10
00:00:47.783 --> 00:00:51.626
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:00:51.626 --> 00:00:56.774
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
